    "created_at": "2023-09-15T13:23:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-15T13:23:11Z",
    "body": "> I'm not sure exactly what is meant by \"HAVE_METADATA but no video data has yet been obtained at all\" because HAVE_METADATA means that video dimensions are known.\r\n\r\nThat would be if the video file's header has been decoded and the audio/video tracks and their properties are known, but no actual video frames have been decoded yet. But I'm not sure if any browsers currently handle this state, or if they actually always decode a frame to be certain about the video size.",
