    "created_at": "2023-09-15T16:54:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-15T16:55:59Z",
    "body": "> I'm not sure if any browsers currently handle this state, or if they actually always decode a frame to be certain about the video size.\r\n\r\nFWIW, Apple WebKit does not even instantiate a decoder when this state is reached. \r\n\r\n(Edit:) To clarify, other WebKit ports may instantiate a decoder and process a video frame in order to be certain about the video size; I'm only speaking for the iOS and macOS ports here.",
